WEBVTT

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:07.300
Just as you promised, tell 
us everything you know.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:18.070
Tell us about the relationship between the 
Public Maintenance Department and Iliaster.

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:20.060
Gulp.

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:21.140
Okay.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:27.710
The reason why I joined the 
Public Maintenance Department

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:31.800
and had to deal with Iliaster 
started with this cup ramen.

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:33.750
What do you mean?

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.170
My family worked as a small circus troop.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:46.880
But our audience was tiny.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:50.320
We couldn't afford food everyday.

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:52.060
How dare you!

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:54.870
Why do you have my Spicy Red 
Dragon Archfiend Noodles?

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:58.200
That's the final one!  Give it back!

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.870
Calm down, Jack.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:01.740
We need it to get valuable information.

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:04.610
Eat it!

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:05.650
Okay!

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:09.930
It's delicious!

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:10.610
Of course it is!

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:13.150
Now keep talking!

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:14.500
Okay.

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:20.430
That's when I encountered 
a bowl of cup ramen.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:24.630
Mother, what is this?

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:29.020
That's for you because it's your birthday.

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:30.790
Eat up.

00:01:31.220 --> 00:01:34.270
How could you afford something so expensive?

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:41.220
Mother must have bought this by 
selling her precious stage costume.

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:45.810
She did that in order to get us 
a single serving of cup ramen.

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:50.280
I couldn't say anything.

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:53.520
Brother, can we eat?

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:55.530
It's going to get cold.

00:01:55.690 --> 00:02:02.190
Okay.  Make sure you 
share so you don't fight.

00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:06.410
Look.  There are shrimp, egg and noodles.

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:10.400
That ramen was delicious.

00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:14.090
Even though the noodles were stale because we

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:16.510
took too long to eat, my 
heart knew it was delicious.

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:21.170
Even the freakish clown lived 
through difficult times...

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:24.900
I understand how you feel!  
It was the same for me!

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:29.480
I shared my cup ramen with 
my friends at Martha's house!

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:31.990
I still haven't forgotten that flavor!

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:36.900
Take this!  And this!  It's for your family!

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:38.770
Wasn't he eating the last one?

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:41.970
Oh my!  Even though it's 
rare, you have so much!

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:43.680
Is it really okay?

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:46.610
It's fine!  Jack Atlas never 
goes back on his word!

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:47.870
Wait, Jack!

00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:49.880
You're going to stop me, Yusei?

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:52.220
Don't tell me you've forgotten that flavor!

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:54.750
Of course I haven't forgotten!

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:59.220
But how does everything he's 
said so far relate to Iliaster?

00:02:59.220 --> 00:02:59.960
Gulp!

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.920
They have nothing to do with each other.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:08.880
Don't worry!

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:11.330
I'm getting to it.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:16.870
The relationship between the Public 
Maintenance Department, Iliaster and me is…

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:21.300
Riding Duels.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:24.340
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:31.280
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:52.510
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:03:52.740 --> 00:04:02.620
Soar in the infinite skies  BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:08.860
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:14.830
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:20.610
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:26.240
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:32.580
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:38.420
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:44.700
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:51.000
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:21.230
Uncover the Mystery!
Riding Duel Endgame!!

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:25.810
The relationship between the Public 
Maintenance Department, Iliaster and me is…

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:31.310
On the day I ate the cup 
ramen, I made a promise.

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:35.660
Someday, I'll have a successful career so 
that I could eat as much cup ramen as I want.

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:39.870
I started working at the Public 
Maintenance Department.

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:45.770
I kissed up to Director Godwin and was 
eventually promoted to Vice Director.

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:52.750
I was able to give cup ramen to my son, 
my wife and my parents as a present.

00:05:55.740 --> 00:06:01.730
And that's the relationship between the 
Public Maintenance Department, cup ramen and me.

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:03.890
What about Iliaster?

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:08.540
Don't you dare end this long-winded 
stupid story like this!

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:10.060
Sherry!

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:14.890
You're trying to avoid 
talking about Iliaster.

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:24.360
To be honest, if I reveal their names, 
my family and I may be in danger.

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:25.760
Are you sure?

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:30.340
If you don't talk, Sherry might 
kill you before Iliaster.

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:33.200
Yeah.

00:06:34.450 --> 00:06:38.640
In the recent incident, there were 
many victims in Neo Domino City.

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:48.290
If we don't stop them, no one will be 
able to smile while eating cup ramen.

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:50.800
Do you want that kind of future?

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.120
My wife!  My son!

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:08.760
I came here in order to protect you.

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:16.130
I understand.  I'll tell 
you everything this time.

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:20.080
...And that's everything.

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:21.790
I see.

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:23.820
Did that help?

00:07:24.090 --> 00:07:28.660
No.  It seems Yusei knows more than you.

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:30.390
What?  Really?

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:38.290
On the day the city was destroyed, they 
appeared and revealed Iliaster's goal.

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:42.380
We didn't introduce ourselves 
yet.  I apologize.

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:45.480
We're Iliaster's three emperors.

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:47.650
Iliaster's three emperors!

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:49.450
Iliaster?

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:53.210
Our goal is to change the future.

00:07:53.690 --> 00:07:58.630
Iliaster's goal is to change the 
future by destroying Moment.

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:03.270
In order to do that, they're going 
to destroy Neo Domino City itself.

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:04.800
What?

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:07.570
They're going to do that?  What's 
Iliaster's true identity?

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:09.760
That's what we're asking you!

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:11.090
This is pointless!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:13.370
I'm taking them all back!

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:15.640
Please don't do that!

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:18.030
What else do I know...

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:19.540
Oh yeah!

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:21.190
The phone call!

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:21.950
Phone call?

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:23.310
What do you mean?

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:30.050
One time, an outside party 
called the three Directors.

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:31.630
Who called?

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:36.980
The details should be in the Public 
Maintenance Department's secret database.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:39.730
Where's the database?

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:41.270
It's at…

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:46.830
The database is here?

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:51.940
Only a handful of people know that it's here.

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:55.080
No matter how you look at it, 
it looks like an arcade machine.

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:56.510
Right?

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:59.220
No one would expect a computer 
terminal to access the

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:03.120
Public Maintenance Department's 
database would be located here.

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:09.950
Even if someone was following me, 
I can safely extract the data.

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:13.360
Is that why you made such a complex disguise?

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:19.670
And if I play hooky and play games, 
I can say that it's for work.

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:22.140
I think that's the real reason.

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:24.650
I don't know if he's amazing or lame.

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:26.140
Here we go.

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:31.010
Cup Ramen Man?

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:35.450
This looks like an endgame duel.

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:38.530
Instead of a password, it's 
a Riding Duel endgame.

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:42.950
Since I developed it, I'll solve it easily.

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:44.890
Get ready?  Duel start!

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:51.330
There are two questions total.  
I get three chances to answer.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:55.340
In other words, if I make three 
mistakes, the PC will be locked.

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:57.240
I have 1000 life points.

00:09:57.420 --> 00:09:59.850
The opponent has 1800 life points.

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:02.120
We both have four Speed Counters.

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:06.320
Cup Meatball Cayenne with 1600 attack 
points is on the opponent's field.

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:10.490
Jester Lord with 0 attack 
points is on my field.

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:15.430
There is one trap on my field, and 
there are two cards in my hand.

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:18.330
A monster with 0 attack points…

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:22.650
The key to this duel is 
increasing its attack points.

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:24.070
Exactly.

00:10:24.070 --> 00:10:28.860
When there are no other monsters 
on my field, Jester Lord gains

00:10:29.280 --> 00:10:35.890
1000 attack points for every spell 
and trap card on both our fields.

00:10:35.890 --> 00:10:37.280
Therefore, I should do this!

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:40.120
I set Speed Spell - Speed Energy.

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:44.520
Then I activate my trap Raigeki Break!

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:52.020
By discarding one card in my hand, 
one card on the field is destroyed.

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:57.000
I send Jester Confit in my hand to the 
graveyard to destroy Cup Meatball Cayenne!

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:05.840
However, when Cup Meatball Cayenne is 
destroyed, all cards in your hand are destroyed!

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:10.100
That won't work on me.

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.790
There are no cards in my hand.

00:11:11.790 --> 00:11:15.020
There's one spell card on the field.

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:18.290
Therefore, Jester Lord 
gains 1000 attack points.

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:21.520
Jester Lord, attack him directly!

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:28.190
This isn't funny!

00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:32.400
But too bad.  I have 800 
life points remaining.

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:36.030
In a Riding Duel endgame, 
you have to win in one turn!

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:37.060
What?

00:11:37.350 --> 00:11:40.130
You failed!

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:48.550
What are you doing?

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:50.720
Didn't you create this puzzle?

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:54.150
Actually, I had my subordinates 
create the puzzles.

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:56.550
This isn't a standing duel.

00:11:56.550 --> 00:12:00.130
You need to use Riding Duel strategy.

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:01.200
I see.

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:03.980
Sheesh, I'll take care of it.

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:04.490
Wait!

00:12:05.230 --> 00:12:06.670
Let me do it.

00:12:06.670 --> 00:12:07.540
Aki…

00:12:07.650 --> 00:12:10.200
I did plenty of riding practice.

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:13.400
I want to help.

00:12:16.730 --> 00:12:18.380
All right, we're counting on you!

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:25.220
Aki!

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:26.490
Do your best!

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:30.770
Use Riding Duel strategy…

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:35.780
That means I need to use 
Speed World 2's effect.

00:12:36.510 --> 00:12:38.740
Then this is what I have to do.

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:53.520
Get ready?  Duel start!

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.190
I activate Speed World 2's effect.

00:12:57.480 --> 00:13:05.860
By removing four Speed Counters, you take 800 
points of damage for every Speed Spell in my hand.

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:12.570
All right!  He only has 
1000 life points remaining!

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:13.150
That means…

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:17.260
I set Speed Spell - Speed Energy.

00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:21.420
Then I activate my trap Raigeki Break!

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:25.480
Due to Raigeki Break's effect, 
I send Jester Confit in

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:29.020
my hand to the graveyard to 
destroy Cup Meatball Cayenne!

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:34.870
Cup Meatball Cayenne's 
monster effect activates!

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.760
But there are no cards in my hand.

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:42.010
There is one spell card on the field.

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:45.780
Jester Lord's attack points increase by 1000.

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:47.970
I attack you directly!

00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:55.120
You win!

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.720
You did it!

00:13:59.840 --> 00:14:01.290
I see.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:05.540
You must first use your Speed Counters to 
take 800 life points away from your opponent.

00:14:06.100 --> 00:14:08.430
That was the key.

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:09.630
You're one to talk!

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:11.960
That was a great Riding Duel!

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:13.550
Your skills have improved, Aki.

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:15.800
It's too early to celebrate.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:17.300
The second puzzle.

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:20.040
If we solve this, we unlock the password!

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:21.540
Leave it to me!

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:24.910
Duel start!

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:28.600
I have 300 life points and 10 Speed Counters.

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:33.710
The opponent has 4000 life 
points and 10 Speed Counters.

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:36.650
The opponent has three monsters on his field.

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:39.760
Jester Queen has been added to my field.

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:44.360
When there are no other 
monsters on my field, Jester

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:48.740
Queen can attack for every card 
in my Spell & Trap Card Zone.

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:51.730
There are two set cards in 
my Spell & Trap Card Zone.

00:14:52.230 --> 00:14:54.570
And there are four cards in my hand.

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:56.310
Can you handle this?

00:14:56.880 --> 00:15:00.910
When Cup Ramen Lard is destroyed, 
all your monsters are destroyed.

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:06.320
When Cup Udon Uno is destroyed, all cards in 
your Spell & Trap Card Zone are destroyed.

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:10.290
If you include Cup Meatball Cayenne's 
effect, this will be difficult.

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:12.630
I don't care about details!

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:15.020
I have 10 Speed Counters!

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:17.360
I'll use them, of course!

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:21.230
I'll show you Jack Atlas's 
overwhelming power!

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:24.050
I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:15:25.140 --> 00:15:34.380
By removing four Speed Counters, you take 800 
points of damage for every Speed Spell in my hand!

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:37.050
I have two Speed Spells in my hand!

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:40.560
You take 1600 points of damage!

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:46.990
I now have 6 Speed Counters!

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:50.190
I activate Speed World 2's effect again!

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:53.730
You take an additional 1600 points of damage!

00:15:57.580 --> 00:15:59.740
He instantly dealt 3200 points of damage.

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:02.210
As always, he's focusing on power.

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:03.940
I'm not done!

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:08.300
I activate Speed Spell - 
Speed Energy from my hand!

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:12.840
When I have two or more Speed Counters...

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:15.110
...one of my monster's 
attack points increase by

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:18.300
the number of Speed Counters 
multiplied by 200 points!

00:16:20.150 --> 00:16:24.020
Jester Queen's attack points 
increase by 400 points.

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:30.170
Then I set two cards in my hand and 
activate Speed Spell - High Speed Crash!

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:36.780
When I have two or more Speed Counters, one 
card on each of our fields are destroyed!

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:40.190
I destroy Jester Lord and 
Cup Meatball Cayenne!

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:44.320
Cup Meatball Cayenne's 
monster effect activates!

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:45.780
Taste this!

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:48.750
But there are no cards in my hand!

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:52.760
Next, I activate Jester 
Queen's monster effect!

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:55.540
There are four cards in 
my Spell & Trap Card Zone.

00:16:55.690 --> 00:16:58.540
Jester Queen can attack four times!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:01.800
Jester Queen attacks Cup Ramen Lard!

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:03.070
Wait, Jack!

00:17:03.070 --> 00:17:04.340
What is it, Yusei?

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:06.030
That monster's effect is…

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:19.900
When Cup Ramen Lard is destroyed, all 
monsters on your field are destroyed!

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:21.080
What?

00:17:25.280 --> 00:17:29.500
You have no monsters!  Therefore, you fail!

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:38.470
You idiot!  Didn't we tell you?

00:17:38.470 --> 00:17:44.500
And even if you could attack four times, Cup 
Udon Uno has more attack points than Jester Queen!

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:47.610
I was just testing a strategy!

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:50.520
I was able to lower his life points to 200!

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:52.520
There's no point if it's not 0!

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:55.990
C'mon now, you both need to calm down.

00:17:56.310 --> 00:17:58.030
Whose fault do you think this is?

00:17:58.980 --> 00:18:01.900
We only have one chance left.

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:06.650
Virtual battles don't suit me!

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:12.100
Actually, your strategy of using 
Speed World 2 twice was correct.

00:18:12.470 --> 00:18:14.670
I think I know how to win.

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:15.810
What do you mean?

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:17.580
The issue is timing.

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:19.150
Timing?

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:21.030
Watch.

00:18:21.230 --> 00:18:22.910
Duel start!

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:27.550
I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:36.030
By removing four Speed Counters, you take 800 
points of damage for every Speed Spell in my hand!

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.930
I have two Speed Spells in my hand.

00:18:38.930 --> 00:18:41.280
Therefore, you take 1600 points of damage.

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:44.400
I'm starting to enjoy this pain.

00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:48.530
Good!  If you do that again, he'll 
only have 800 life points left!

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:51.100
But that will be the same as last time.

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:52.150
That's right.

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:56.690
Everyone usually wants to deal as 
much damage as possible at the start.

00:18:56.980 --> 00:18:58.120
However, I'll…

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:06.150
I activate Speed Spell - 
Speed Energy from my hand!

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:09.930
Due to Speed Energy's effect, 
Jester Queen's attack points

00:19:09.930 --> 00:19:13.480
ncrease by the number of Speed 
Counters multiplied by 200 points!

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:17.180
Then I activate Speed World 2's effect!

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:19.370
I have one Speed Spell in my hand.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:24.610
By removing four Speed Counters, 
you take 800 points of damage!

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:30.760
Why?  You could've dealt 
3200 points of damage!

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:34.490
It's true that he dealt half 
the damage for 800 points.

00:19:34.490 --> 00:19:38.600
But in exchange, he increased 
Jester Queen's attack points.

00:19:39.010 --> 00:19:43.420
I activate Speed Spell - High 
Speed Crash from my hand.

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:47.440
I destroy Jester Lord and Cup Udon Uno!

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:55.960
When Cup Udon Uno is destroyed, all cards in 
your Spell & Trap Card Zone are destroyed!

00:19:58.450 --> 00:19:59.990
Why Cup Udon Uno?

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:04.490
Without any cards, he can't 
use Jester Queen's effect!

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:06.790
But Yusei still has…

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:07.810
That's right.

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:13.380
I set the trap cards Discord and 
Imperial Custom that are in my hand!

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:17.470
Now Jester Queen can attack twice.

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:20.310
If I can attack twice, that's plenty!

00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:23.100
Jester Queen, attack Cup Meatball Cayenne!

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:30.820
Cup Meatball Cayenne's effect!

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:35.510
I have no cards in my hand!

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:38.970
It's time for the second 
attack!  Go, Jester Queen!

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:40.910
Destroy Cup Ramen Lard!

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:54.230
It's over!

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:56.620
You win!

00:20:57.980 --> 00:20:59.170
All right!

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:00.930
Well done, Yusei!

00:21:01.740 --> 00:21:03.880
I didn't win all by myself.

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:06.890
Jack and Aki, it's thanks to you.

00:21:07.170 --> 00:21:08.410
Yusei…

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:09.530
What about me?

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:12.320
Hurry up and get the data!

00:21:12.970 --> 00:21:14.990
Oh yeah.

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:18.830
I'll access the external call records.

00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:31.250
This is it.

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:35.340
The person who called the 
three Directors was…

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:38.200
What's this?

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:42.000
Moment Express Development Organization.

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:56.660
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:21:57.130 --> 00:22:03.370
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you

00:22:16.350 --> 00:22:21.650
You always pretend and hide your fears

00:22:21.990 --> 00:22:27.290
You act tough and don't listen to anyone

00:22:27.590 --> 00:22:32.900
You do this over and over

00:22:33.260 --> 00:22:38.640
I shouted until my soul would break

00:22:38.900 --> 00:22:44.040
Hurry up and throw that away

00:22:44.580 --> 00:22:51.550
We're only heading towards tomorrow

00:22:51.980 --> 00:22:57.290
Close to you  If you're 
trying to find yourself

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:03.130
Just keep doing what you ultimately decided

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:08.600
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:23:09.100 --> 00:23:16.710
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you
